^warning: ignoring
^CONVERSION ERROR$
--
In a statement, the parser tried an initializer before a parameter list, so
`(A)' after `(*p)' became the initializer of an int *p: "invalid implicit
conversion from 'auto (*)(A) -> signed int' to 'signed int *'".
